Type of Parameters:
------------------
    1. Choice Parameter:
        - used for predefined values (e.g branch names, environment names, etc.)
        Example:
        --------
            development
            master
            QA
            production

    2. String Parameter:
        - user enters value manually
        Example:
        --------
            Name = person_name

    3. Boolean Parameter:
        - True/False option

    How it works:
    -------------
    Enable: this project is parameterized
    Use variable:
    ------------
        ${branch_name}

    Example (Freestyle job)
    -----------------------
    Branch selection: ${branch_name}

    Shell script:
    ------------
    echo "Branch selected: ${branch_name}"

    Output Behavior:
    ----------------
    select value during build
    job runs with selected inputs


